===''[[Monster's Fair]]''===
Godzillas appear as a common enemy in the grass stages of ''[[Monster's Fair]]'' alongside [[Matango]]s, [[Hedorah]]s, [[Minilla]]s, and in later stages of the game, [[Rodan]]s. Godzillas primarily walk diagonally both up and down the screen, and can damage [[Mothra]] either through firing atomic breath or by charging into her; the latter will kill the Godzilla in a suicide attack. Unlike many of the enemies in the game, Godzillas can't be stunned by Mothra's webs and so the player will have to be careful to avoid being damaged while attacking them. Godzillas will die to five hits of Mothra's webs or one power ball, awarding 1,000 points upon being killed.
