Godzilla, bearing his [[Godzilla (Heisei)|Heisei appearance]], appears in the survival RPG ''[[City Shrouded in Shadow]]'' developed by Granzella and Bandai Namco for the PlayStation 4. Godzilla appears in stage six, where he attacks a freighter; stage eight, where he battles against [[King Ghidorah]]; and stage 13, where he destroys a city before being repelled by [[Kiryu]]. As with the other [[kaiju]] in the game, the player cannot fight or resist Godzilla and must try to evade him to avoid being killed.
